  "purpose": "Test only the three delegated media-host relationships empirically exposed by the completed first-party media-subdomain V2 diagnostic. A delegated vendor host is not treated as first-party source authority merely because a club URL redirects to it. This audit verifies the exact official-origin delegation path, inventories bounded historical release/roster/depth candidate surfaces on the exact delegated host, and records club-attribution evidence for future source-design decisions.",
